  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.37 Municipality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.37 \"Municipality\" means ''municipality\" as defined in RSA 672:10, namely \"cities, towns, village districts, and counties in which there are located unincorporated towns or unorganized places.\"\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
